    "description": "<p><strong>Spend 2 Fear</strong> to move the Elephant to a point within Far range. All creatures in its path must make an Agility Reaction Roll (16). Targets who fail take <strong>3d10+5</strong> direct physical damage and are knocked over, making them <em>Vulnerable</em> until they next act. Targets who succeed take half damage and aren’t knocked over.</p>",
